    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, <Picture 4> and <Picture 5>, a white woman in her mid-twenties with dark brown, wavy, shoulder-length hair.\n<Subject 2> is the room in <Picture 6>, <Picture 7>, <Picture 8> and <Picture 9>, a softly lit apartment living room with grey walls, a white wardrobe by the window, a low white TV bench, a white dining table with chairs under a paper globe lamp, a grey sofa and large framed pictures.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] <Subject 1> walks slowly into <Subject 2> and stops to look around.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the woman's facial identity and hairstyle are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the room's layout, furniture, colours and light are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a realistic, full-color cinematic shot in soft natural light.\n[Shot 1] The camera stands at eye level and faces the white wardrobe beside the window, as in <Picture 6>. <Subject 1>, wearing a navy t-shirt and jeans, walks slowly into the room from the side, stops in the middle of it and looks around. The camera turns slowly to follow her.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet room tone and soft footsteps.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
